<title>SWITZERLAND: Holderbank sees positive 1997.</title>
<headline>Holderbank sees positive 1997.</headline>
<dateline>GLARUS, Switzerland 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holderbank Financiere Glarus AG, the world's leading cement producer, said the outlook for 1997 was promising.</p>
<p>&quot;This view is based on continued economic strength in the U.S. and most Latin American countries. Favourable trends are also visible in most other markets,&quot; Holderbank wrote in a statement on its 1996 results.</p>
</text>
